<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal Telecom launches 25 bln esc bond.</title>
<headline>Portugal Telecom launches 25 bln esc bond.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Portugal Telecom (PT) is issuing a 25 billion escudo five-year bond, joint lead managers Banco ESSI and Banco Portugues de Investimentos (BPI) said.</p>
<p>The issue carries a fixed coupon of 6.15 percent and there is a call option in the third year.</p>
</text>
